  "description": "Ga-Yeon knows what men want. She knows what it takes to fulfill their fantasies, and loves the power that comes with the conquest of even the most arrogant of men. Nothing can strip her of that confidence. Not even a sudden warp to a foreign land, and not even the fact that she has to become a random emperor’s concubine. Why would that faze her? The emperor Zeros is good looking, has a hot bod, and acts aloof. He’s just the kind of man that she’s used to dealing with. It won’t take too long for her to make him hers…or will it?\n\n(Source: Lezhin)\n\n*Note: Includes ten extra chapters.*",
